== region old_town
name: Old Town
travel order: 1
map grid: 8 x 8
image: old_town_map

== zone streets
name: The streets
ambient:
    A gust of wind sends loose paper skittering along the empty street.

    Somewhere far away, glass breaks. Then everything is quiet again.

    You pass a row of abandoned cars, their doors hanging open.

== location shelter
name: Basement Shelter
rest: bed
region: old_town
zone: none
map: 3, 4
flags: safe rest, known at start
image: shelter
exits:
    up: plaza
description:
    A low concrete room lit by a single battery lantern. Cots line one wall, and a shelf holds what is left of the supplies.

== location plaza
name: Town Plaza
region: old_town
zone: streets
map: 3, 3
image: plaza
flags: fast travel
exits:
    down: shelter
    east: market
description:
    A wide square of cracked paving stones around a dry fountain. [if time is night]The streetlights are dead, and the dark feels close.[else]Pale daylight shows every abandoned stall.[end if]

== location market
name: Covered Market
region: old_town
zone: streets
map: 4, 3
image: market
exits:
    west: plaza
items: can_of_beans
description:
    Rows of empty stalls under a sagging glass roof. Most of the shelves were stripped long ago.
